-- 3. THE BRIDGE: sensorfw -> QtSensors, and it is a 6-entry table ----------------
# This is the only place the sensorfw value is translated. It lives in the QtSensors
# sensorfw backend, which is what QOrientationSensor uses on this port. Read it out
# of the installed binary, because a table is smaller than a switch and cannot be
