-- 5. WHAT qtmir DOES WITH IT: four of the six values are handled, and the two face
--    values are not.
#
# The event is built in PlatformScreen::onOrientationReadingChanged (it stores the
# QOrientationReading::Orientation at offset 20 of a small event object whose vptr is
# set from .data.rel.ro, then QCoreApplication::postEvent) and consumed in
